Subject: [PATCH] DOM: test that scattered collection indexing and normalize()
 take linear time (Sunset P2)

Time from n to 4n: about 4 when linear, 16 when quadratic. Both fail
before the change that follows (12.5 and 12.1): children[i] at scattered
positions over 20,000 took 363 ms, normalize() over 20,000 text nodes
375 ms. A third keeps a Range across an empty and two merged nodes.

